    "body": "## Description\n\nPreserve the user simulator's assistant tool calls and matching tool results when forwarding tau2 conversation history to the OpenAI-compatible client. The previous user-specific cleanup removed both, so the simulator could not see its own tool observations on later turns. Keep the existing removal of `tool_calls: null` for API compatibility.\n\nAdd a focused regression test for the tool-call/result pair and input-message immutability.\n\n## Related Issue\n\nFixes #1741\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Validation\n\n- `uvx pre-commit run --files examples/tau2/agent.py tests/test_tau2_messages.py` passed.\n- Ruff lint and format checks passed; `python3 -m compileall -q` passed.\n- A dependency-free direct check of `_clean_messages` passed.\n- `uv run --no-project --with pytest pytest tests/test_tau2_messages.py -q -rs` skipped because the optional `tau2` package is not installed locally.\n- `uvx pre-commit run --all-files` completed all checks except the unrelated CLI documentation generator, whose system Python lacks `mdformat`; a retry with `mdformat` available reached a missing `omegaconf` dependency. No generated files changed.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] I have read the Contributing Guide.\n- [x] Relevant changed-file pre-commit hooks pass.\n- [x] Regression test added; optional-dependency skip documented above.\n- [x] Branch is based on the current `main` at preparation time.\n- [x] This PR was created with a coding agent.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
